msgctxt "64"
msgid "Where... the hell... did you find this freakin' lunatic!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"So, you pretend that people dent your car in order to pressure them into "
"paying up, and then have them sign a phony agreement in order to seal the "
"deal. Right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "That's... basically our entire scheme, so... yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Then you'd better stop with this nonsense right now. Or else you're the one "
"who's gonna need the dents buffed out of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Yes, sir... I'm really sorry about all this! We'll be out\r\n"
"of your hair immediately!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Oh, and please take this. I hope we can put all this behind\r\n"
"us and go our separate ways."
msgstr ""

